		"title": "Prayer Opens Eternal Vision",
		"summary": "",
		"body": "Today’s meditation brings us to prayer opens eternal vision through the gospel. This truth reaches the way we see God, ourselves, and the people around us.\n\nSin pulls the self into the center. We want control, approval, comfort, and a life that follows our plan more than the glory and will of God.\n\nChrist came to rescue us from ourselves. He bears our sin, becomes our righteousness, and gives the Spirit so that we may walk in a new way.\n\nSo today, do not let this truth remain a correct sentence. Bring your heart to God, confess what he exposes, and depend on Christ for one step of faithful obedience.\n\nPrayer\n\nFather, praise you for your glory and grace. Forgive my self-centeredness and fear. Thank you for Christ, my righteousness and hope. Holy Spirit, lead this truth into humble obedience today. In Jesus’ name, amen."
